</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ha</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray.LoopBound\">WordArray.LoopBound</a> <span class=\"fn\">a</span> <span class=\"fn\">ao</span> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hb</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/WordArray.html#MPN.WordArray.LoopBound\">WordArray.LoopBound</a> <span class=\"fn\">b</span> <span class=\"fn\">bo</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hn</span> : <span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">n</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hU</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">m</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HAdd.hAdd\">+</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize.size\">USize.size</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">s</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">A</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The division in place with the shift `s` that sets the top bit of `b`: `a` copied if `s = 0`, else\n`a` and `b` shifted left by `s` bits, then divided by `loopN`. The array holds the quotient in\nlimbs `n` to `m` and the remainder, shifted left by `s` bits, in limbs `0` to `n - 1`.","docLink":"./MPN/Div/Basecase.html#MPN.Schoolbook.workS","kind":"def","line":150,"name":"MPN.Schoolbook.workS","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9